<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Metrod 6-mth net up 30.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Metrod 6-mth net up 30.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		     (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 6.99	 vs	  5.37</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		0.17	 vs	  0.28</p>
<p>    Turnover		 316.57	 vs	287.60</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  8.04	  vs	  7.57</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Metrod (Malaysia) Bhd. It makes electrical conductivity copper wires, rods and strips and other products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
